{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：S03、S08、S12等短停留段落的信息点和感受交替较密，纵向扫读容易来不及消化，X的左右分栏在快速浏览上更轻松。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y更能让我理解这不是简单的离开、后悔、释怀，而是逐渐分清对旧日亲近的想念、对受过委屈的不甘，以及对未来孤独的恐惧，最后才走到不逼自己选边、带着想念继续生活。每段【】都提供了明确的注意力落点，而且音乐感受不仅有情绪，还有力度、节奏、音区、旋律变化和具体身体体验，尤其S03至S13的情绪转折比X细腻得多。X的叙事更顺滑、扫读更轻松，但部分音乐感受和人物心理被概括得较粗，Y虽然信息密度更高，却提供了更多真正有区分度的体验。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "ff2ec44f-fa69-49b6-8f8a-753c656993f4", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T214310680712Z", "elapsed_seconds": 84.235, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T21:44:34.920502+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "3e373556fe9898428dad70bd9c51253d252ec83c9aada8feb5f195e1d6a8b303", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc42223